    /// <summary>
    /// &lt;p&gt;Returns the account identifier for the specified access key ID.&lt;/p&gt;
    /// &lt;p&gt;Access keys consist of two parts: an access key ID (for example,
    /// &lt;code&gt;AKIAIOSFODNN7EXAMPLE&lt;/code&gt;) and a secret access key (for example,
